      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Pet owners highlight the patience shown to rescue animals, anxious dogs, and recovering cats during examinations. Multiple reviewers note that the veterinary assistants take extra time to calm nervous pets and avoid rushing appointments. Clients express confidence when bringing in sensitive animals for vaccinations and general wellness check-ups."
      }
    },
