      "title": {
        "en": "Mixed experiences with practice communication"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Several clients appreciate prompt text message updates, telephone consultations, and detailed post-visit instructions. Conversely, other reviewers express frustration with appointment cancellations, lack of diagnostic explanations during urgent visits, and frequent marketing emails. Pet owners recommend confirming booking procedures and fees in advance of appointments."
      }
